              "text": "पुतण्या — putaṇyā — \"a brother's son\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "माझा पुतण्या पुण्यात शिकतो. mājhā putaṇyā puṇyāt śikto. My nephew studies in Pune."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A brother's son; a brother's daughter is पुतणी."
            }
          ]
        },
