              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पुतण्या (putaṇyā) is inherited: CDIAL lists Marathi putṇyā, \"brother's son\", under the reconstructed pitriyajāni, \"wife of one of the father's family\" (CDIAL 8189)."
            }
