              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भाचा — bhācā — \"a sister's son\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सुट्टीत माझा भाचा आमच्याकडे राहायला आला. suṭṭīt mājhā bhācā āmcyākaḍe rāhāylā ālā. My nephew came to stay with us in the holidays."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A sister's son; भाची, a sister's daughter. To the child, the mother's brother is मामा."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भाचा (bhācā) is filed by CDIAL under bhrātrya, \"pertaining to a brother\", together with Prakrit bhacca, \"sister's son\" (CDIAL 9673); how a brother's word came to name a sister's son is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
